<div class="section bordered tinted">
  <div class="medium center">
    <div class="big-quote">Your plan isn't fixed.<br /><span class="accent-text">Because you aren't either.</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .section.bordered {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
